        <p>No Y,NTILUSIASM.—First Anarchist : "Vy you atiourn zo zoon at dot dynamite clup last night?" Second Anarchist: " Dere Iris no enthusiasm." "Vat? No enthusiasm vo: liperty, equality, and fn.ternity ?" ." Not a pit. We run out off peer." CARLUTHERS : " Were you really as drunk as you sculled last night?" " IVaites : "Well, that depend.; I was not as drunk as I seemed to you, and a great deal drunker tian I seemed to my- self."</p>
        <p>" teach you to play pitch - and - toss," shouted an enraged father. "I'll flog you for an hour, i will." "Father," instantly replied the incorrijble, as he balanced a penny on his thumb and flt:g,er, "I'll toss you to make it two hours or nothin .</p>
