        <p>An item of interest to anyone afflicted with a bad cough which nothing seems to relieve is that which tells him of a certain cure. Angler's Petroleum Emulsion will cure the worst cough, no matter of how long standing, even though other remedies have been tried without effect. It is a food-medicine pleasant to take, and con- tains no opiate or other harmful narcotic. It not only cures stubborn coughs and prevents serious throat and lung troubles, but it promotes appetite, aids digestion, increases weight and strength' and builds up the system generally. It is prescribed by medical men generally. and is sold by all leading chemists, price 2s. 91. and 44 6d.. A sample b.)ttle sent free on receipt of 31. to cover postage. Dascriptive pamphlet post free. Angier Chemical Co., 32, Snow Rill, London, E. 0..</p>
