        <p>ington be appointed trustees, and the Rev. it. Greenell, Messrs. E. Eliehmancl, Josiah Longlaod and John k_oxon, managers. &amp;Ir. Hepherd seconded, and it was carried unanimouslY. —Mr. F. Monks then moved that the following geutleinen be the committee of management in addition to the trustees : —Revs. Jahn Yonge, W. H. Drummond, Richard Greenell, Messrs. John Peers, John Harrison, Thomas Whittle and J. H. not-Mag.—Mr. R. Garnett seconded, and the recommendation was approved ot.</p>
